        "sid": "MRK 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu na anafundzie ariphofika phephi na Jerusalemu afika Bethifage na Bethania, ko Mwango wa Mizaituni. Midzi iyo kala i phephi na Jerusalemu. Hipho Jesu wahuma anafundzie airi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "achiaambira, “Phiyani hinyo mudzi wa pho mbere, na mchiinjira tu mundaona mwana punda akafungbwa, naye kadzangbwepandwa ni mutu. Mvuguleni mumrehe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mutu ndiyekuuzani, ‘Mnayeni ye mwana punda, mbona munamvugula?’ Muambeni, ‘Bwana ana haja naye na achimala andamuuyiza mara mwenga.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi aphiya na achendakuta mwana punda akafungbwa mryangoni phatu phereru. Ariphokala anamvugula, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "atu ariokala aimire phephi aauza, “Mnahendadze! Mbona munamvugula ye mwana punda?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao achigomba viratu arivyolagizwa ni Jesu; na atu achiarichira aphiye vyao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariphomrehera Jesu yuya mwana punda, ahandika nguwo zao dzuluye, naye achipanda achisagala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu anji ahandika nguwo zao barabarani, na anjina achihandika makandza ga mitende ambago kala akagakata mo mindani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ayahudi ahenda hivyo kuonyesa ishima yao kpwa mutu muhimu, ama kuonyesa ushindi wakati mfalume anauya kula vihani.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.118.25+PSA.118.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zaburi 118:25–26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi ariokala mbere na ariokala nyuma osi akota kululu achiamba:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ariphofika Jerusalemu, wakpwendamenya Nyumba ya Kuvoya Mlungu. Bada ya kulola chila chitu, kpwa vira kala kukatswa waphiya vyakpwe Bethania phamwenga na anafundzie kumi na airi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku ya phiriye, Jesu ariphokala anauya kula Bethania, kala ana ndzala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waona muhi uihwao mtini kure chidide, uriokala na makodza, achiaphuka kpwendalola ichikala wavyala. Ela ariphofika hipho wakuta makodza mahuphu, mana kala sio msimu wa tini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu waulani hura muhi achiamba, “Atu taandarya matundago tsona bii!” Na anafundzie achisikira gara maneno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ariphofika Jerusalemu, wamenya Nyumba ya Kuvoya Mlungu na achiandza kuzoresa atu ariokala anahenda bishara mo ndani. Achipendula-pendula meza za hara okala anabadilisha pesa na vihi vya hara okala anaguza njiya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wala kayamruhusu mutu yeyesi kutikanya na chitu cha kuguza mura ndani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.56.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isaya 56:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.7.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jeremia 7:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu achiafundza hara atu, “Maneno ga Mlungu gaandikpwa, ‘Nyumba yangu indaihwa nyumba ya mavoyo kpwa atu a mataifa gosi.’ Ela mwino munaihenda kukala mwamdzifwitso wa aivi!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akulu a alavyadzi-sadaka na alimu a Shariya ariphosikira higo aendza njira ya kumuolaga. Mana amuogopha, kpwa sababu kundi kulu ra atu kala rikaangalazwa ni mafundzoge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dziloniye, Jesu na anafundzie auka mudzi hinyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ligundzure Jesu na anafundzie ariphokala anaphiya Jerusalemu aona hura muhi wa mtini ukanyala wosi hadi mizi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero achitambukira, achimuamba, “Mwalimu, lola! Hura mtini urio ulani dzana, ukanyala.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu achiajibu achiamba, “Mkuluphireni Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.17.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 17:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.13.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Akorintho 13:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakuambirani kpweli, mutu anaweza kuuambira mwango hinyu, ‘Ngʼoka ukadzitiye baharini.’ Mutu hiye achikuluphira bila wasiwasi kukala go agombago gandakala, naye Mlungu andamuhendera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo, nakuambirani chochosi ndichomvoya Mlungu, kuluphirani kukala mkachiphokera, namwi mundachiphaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.6.14+MAT.6.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 6:14–15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na muimapho kuvoya, na phana mutu yeyesi ariyekukoserani, mswameheni kpwandza, ili Sowe yenu ariye mlunguni piya aswamehe makosa genu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ichikala tamundaaswamehe, phahi Sowe yenu ariye mlunguni kandaswamehe makosa genu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:26",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Vitabu vyanjina vya kare tavina msitari wa 26.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu na anafundzie auya tsona Jerusalemu, na achendainjira Nyumba ya Kuvoya Mlungu. Jesu ariphokala ananyendeka himo, akulu a alavyadzi-sadaka, alimu a Shariya, na vilongozi anjina a Chiyahudi amlunga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "achendamuuza, “We, gano unagogahenda, unahenda kpwa uwezo wa ani? Ni ani yekupha uwezo huno wa kuhenda mambo higa?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achiaambira, “Nindakuuzani swali, mchinijibu, nami nindakuambirani nahenda mambo higa kpwa uwezo wa ani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niambirani, uwezo wa Johana wa kubatiza, wala kpwa Mlungu hebu wala kpwa atu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi aphiya njama, achendabisha enye kpwa enye, achiamba, “Huchiamba, ‘Wala mlunguni,’ andahuamba, ‘Sambi mbona tamyamkuluphira?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na tahuweza kuamba, ‘Wala kpwa atu.’ ” (Agomba hivyo kpwa sababu aogopha kuphaha tabu, mana atu osi akubali kukala Johana kala ni nabii kpweli.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi amuamba Jesu, “Tahumanya.” Naye achiaambira, “Wala nami sindakuambirani nahenda mambo higa kpwa uwezo wa ani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
